" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,4)\">Josh 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 3:12\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,12)\">Josh 3:12</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 28:54\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"54\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"54\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,54)\">Deut 28:54</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 23:12\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(6,23,12)\">Josh 23:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,2)\">2Sam 21:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,11)\">2Kgs 25:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,15)\">Jer 52:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,18)\">Ezek 34:18</ref> of a rescued remnant of Israel (Judah) <ref ref=\"Mic 5:2\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(33,5,2)\">Mic 5:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:9\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,9)\">Zeph 2:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שְׁאֵרִית</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Zech 14:2\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,2)\">Zech 14:2</ref> <bdbheb>יֶתֶר הַקָּדֵשׁ אֲשֶׁר נִשְׁאַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:47\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,47)\">1Kgs 22:47</ref> <bdbheb>יֶתֶר הָעָם הַנִּשְׁאָרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 36:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,9)\">Jer 36:9</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,11)\">2Kgs 25:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,15)\">Jer 52:15</ref> . <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>remainder, rest, other part</highlight> of people, elders, etc., <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,10)\">2Sam 10:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,11)\">1Chr 19:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:28\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,28)\">2Sam 12:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:23\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,23)\">1Kgs 12:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,1)\">Jer 29:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hab 2:8\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,8)\">Hab 2:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,23)\">Ezek 48:23</ref> sometimes including a majority <ref ref=\"Judg 7:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,6)\">Judg 7:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,2)\">1Sam 13:2</ref> of common people (opposed to rulers) <ref ref=\"Neh 2:16\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(16,2,16)\">Neh 2:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 4:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,8)\">Neh 4:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 4:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,13)\">Neh 4:13</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Neh 6:1\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(16,6,1)\">Neh 6:1</ref> of land <ref ref=\"Deut 3:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,13)\">Deut 3:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,27)\">Josh 13:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); of other inanimate things <ref ref=\"Lev 14:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,17)\">Lev 14:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Num 31:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,32)\">Num 31:32</ref> (<highlight>id.</highlight>), of years <ref ref=\"Isa 38:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,10)\">Isa 38:10</ref> elsewhere in phrase <bdbheb>יֶחֶר דִּבְרֵי</bdbheb> <highlight>the rest of the affairs of</highlight>, in summaries of reigns of kings of Israel and Judah <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:41\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,41)\">1Kgs 11:41</ref> + 41 t. Kings Chronicles; <bdbheb>יֶתֶר כָּלדִּֿבְרֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 15:23\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(11,15,23)\">1Kgs 15:23</ref> <bdbheb>יֶתֶר דְּבָרָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:26\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,26)\">2Chr 28:26</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. a.</b> <highlight>excess</highlight>, <bdbheb>שְׂפַת יָ֑תֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,7)\">Prov 17:7</ref> <highlight>a lip of excess</highlight> = arrogant speech (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('VB')\"><reflink>VB</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> in adverb phrases, <bdbheb>עַל יֶתֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 31:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,24)\">Ps 31:24</ref> <highlight>on the basis of abundance = abundantly</highlight>, as adverb accusative <bdbheb>גָּדוֺל יֶתֶר מְאֹד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 56:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,12)\">Isa 56:12</ref> great, <highlight>in abundance</highlight>, exceedingly, <ref ref=\"Dan 8:9\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,9)\">Dan 8:9</ref> <bdbheb>וַתִּגְדַּליֶֿתֶר</bdbheb> and grew great <highlight>in excess, exceedingly</highlight> (compare <placeholder2376/> <highlight>much</highlight>, <placeholder2377/> <highlight>more than</highlight>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> specifically <highlight>what is over and above</highlight> immediate necessities, <highlight>abundance, affluence</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 22:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,20)\">Job 22:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 17:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,14)\">Ps 17:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>superiority, excellency</highlight> <bdbheb>יֶתֶר שְׂאֵת וְיֶתֶר עָ֫ז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,3)\">Gen 49:3</ref>. — On <ref ref=\"Job 4:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,1)\">Job 4:1</ref> see  II. <bdbheb><reflink>יֶתֶר</reflink></bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Neh 2:16", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Prov 17:7", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Gen 49:3", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 49, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 56:12", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 56, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 44:19", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 44, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Exod 23:11", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 23, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Job 4:21", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 4, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Joel 1:4", "book": "JOL", "chapter": 1, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Exod 10:5", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 10, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Jer